        "id": 157292,
        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-29T17:00:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh man. The half of me that plays Go and has always been smug about its complexity and has always said, \"Well, computers still have a long way to go to master&nbsp;<em>this</em> game\" is really kinda sweating and off in the corner. The half of me that loves the progression of technology is thrilled. I'm at battle with myself.</p><p>It's only managed to beat a 2-dan pro, though. The match I'm super interested in is the 8-dan pro match in March.</p>",
